Description: PIPET predicts relevant subpopulations in single-cell data from phenotypic information in bulk data. Core prediction functions only depend on Matrix, Seurat, and matrixStats. Visualization and marker-extraction utilities require tidyverse, DESeq2, survminer (moved to Suggests).
